@host = https://localhost:7092

### Создать задачу
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy beer",
  "priority": 2 
}

### Список всех задач
GET {{host}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Завершить задачу
PUT {{host}}/tasks/e84783db-b62f-4df0-a399-60d236ea30fa/complete
Accept: application/json

### Удалить задачу
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000